\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to support peso. \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Mai 1998\par 01:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, May 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it sold $82.5 million on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday in an effort to shore up the country's peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The bank generally refrains from commenting on its forays into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  or interbank market. But it revealed the amount of Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on its Internet page on the World Wide Web. \par \par \uc2  Coupled with its dollar sales last Thursday and Friday, all aimed at giving the peso much-needed support, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has drained $106 million from its net foreign reserves in less than a week. \par \par \uc2  Salomon Kalmanovitz, a member of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's board of directors, conceded in a brief interview with Reuters that Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level was "worrisome" given the amount of reserves it had to spend in its bid to move the thinly-traded market. \par \par \uc2  This is especially true since the peso closed Tuesday at a new historic low of 1,396.73, despite the bank's effort to prop it up. \par \par \uc2  Kalmanovitz said reserves totalling $9.920 billion still provided the bank with ample ammunition to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, and offered a solid base "for the economy and monetary policy." \par \par \uc2  Political uncertainty ahead of Sunday's presidential elections is among the factors most often cited for the peso's rapid depreciation in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  (( - Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944, fax 571 610 7733, bogota.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du5q04g48\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
