\par\par \b \uc2  Colombian Peso Fights Back Against U.S. Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 1998\par 22:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--The Colombian peso strengthened against the dollar on Tuesday, ending two weeks of devaluation against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that led to heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The peso's average exchange rate fell to 1349.68 to the dollar from 1351.15 pesos to the dollar the previous day, rewarding efforts to bolster the troubled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars and hiking interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's trading fluctuated between 1351.40 and 1346.60 pesos to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The total \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  volume was $219 million, slightly lower than $220 million the previous day. \par \par \uc2  'The measures taken (by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) finally worked,' a trader said, referring to a hike in the daily repurchase agreement rate, or Repos rate, to 30% from 27%. The move was designed to reduce liquidity and counter speculation against the peso, but failed to prevent it from slipping further on Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso had fallen for two consecutive weeks when the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par hiked the Repos rate Friday, prompting the bank to pump dollars into the\par market. While it is difficult to know exactly how many dollars the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sells on a given day, traders estimated the bank sold $150\par million Monday.\par -By Ruth Morris; 201-938-2269; rmorris@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2151GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1068 1845 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2h01c93\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
