\par\par \b \uc2  Exotic  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  -4:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Was Confirmed \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 1997\par 19:42\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Cardenas said he expects the peso to strengthen marginally in the coming weeks, but he didn't offer a year-end prediction. \par \par \uc2  The Colombia peso trades between a floor and a ceiling set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  late last year. The midpoint of the exchange band has depreciated against the dollar by 15% over the course of 1997, according to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys dollars when the dollar hits its floor of the band - the peso's top value - and sells dollars when it hits its ceiling - the peso's weak point. \par \par \uc2  The dollar hit its floor several times at the beginning of the year, but the peso has weakened gradually away from that level as the year progressed. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the floor of the band was set at 1,113.11 and the ceiling was set at 1,280.67 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has repeatedly stated it will maintain the current \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  scheme, and many analysts believe that assertion. \par \par \uc2  As a rule, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows the peso to fluctuate freely with free market forces within the band. But when the peso shows abrupt movements, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy is to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow those movements. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy is not to comment on its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, although Ocampo confirmed that about $200 million was spent earlier this month in \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the peso's abrupt slide. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT  24-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1742GMT \par \par \uc2  1106 1802 1805 1838 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt9o00dz5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
