\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Peso/Amplifier -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 1997\par 01:37\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2  peso trades between a floor and a ceiling set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  late last year. The midpoint of the exchange band has depreciated against the dollar by 15% over the course of 1997, according to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys dollars when the dollar hits its floor of the band - the peso's top value - and sells dollars when it hits its ceiling - the peso's weak point. \par \par \uc2  The dollar hit its floor several times at the beginning of the year, but the peso has weakened gradually away from that level as the year progressed. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the floor of the band was set at 1,107.16 and the ceiling was set at 1,273.82 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  While Ocampo and other analysts agreed the slide of the peso over the last two weeks will make the peso more competitive, they say the slide, especially on Monday and Tuesday, is excessive. \par \par \uc2  Ocampo, who as finance minister also presides over the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board of directors, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and government have sold about $200 million on Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market over the last two weeks to slow the peso's slide. \par \par \uc2  Analysts believe the peso would have fallen further had the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but they were unable to say by how much. \par \par \uc2  Rico said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sufficient reserve levels to slow the peso's slide. \par \par \uc2  The slide of the peso over the last two weeks is mostly speculative movements caused by several factors, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "There are no structural economic reasons that would have caused this (weakening of the peso)," said Paula Garcia, an analyst with ING-Barings in Bogota. \par \par \uc2  The unrest in Colombia's countryside caused by the upcoming municipal elections is the most commonly cited reason for the weaker peso, said traders and analysts. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT  09-09-97 \par \par \uc2  2337GMT \par \par \uc2  1192 1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt9900cqa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
