\par\par \b \uc2  Colombia  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -2: Govt. Sells $7.5 Mln \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 1997\par 23:06\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $30 million on Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to slow the slide of the peso on Tuesday, Finance Minister Jose Antonio Ocampo said. \par \par \uc2  Ocampo, who spoke to reporters while defending the government's budget deficit in congress, said the government spent an additional $7.5 million to slow the peso's weakening trend against the dollar on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  As finance minister, Ocampo presides over the board of directors of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is aware of its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2  peso's average exchange rate was 1,239.79 to the peso, a decline of 2.9% from Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dollar traders have cited several causes for the ongoing decline of the peso, including the ongoing campaign of terror in Colombia's countryside as the Oct. 26 municipal elections approach. \par \par \uc2  Ocampo said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the government have spent a total of $200 million over the last two weeks in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Despite that, the peso has fallen 6.3% against the dollar in the same\par period.\par    -Keefe Borden\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT  09-09-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2106GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt9900cpp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
