\par\par \b \uc2  Colombia Peso Opens Weaker Vs. Dollar Amid Volatile Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 1997\par 16:54\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--The Colombia peso opened weaker Tuesday amid volatile trading marked by the scarcity of dollars on the spot market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  At 13:45 GMT, about 90 minutes after the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market opened, the peso was trading at about 1,234 to the dollar, from a close of 1,215.0 to the dollar on Monday. \par \par \uc2  More than $110 million had been traded in the first 90 minutes of Tuesday's session, an active volume. \par \par \uc2  Traders say the market is similar to Monday, with strong movements and volatile trading. \par \par \uc2  Relatively few dollars are available on Tuesday's spot market in part because exporters are trading in forward \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  for future deliveries. \par \par \uc2  "I expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to follow the trading closely today," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market over the last two weeks to prop up the peso, but traders were unsure if they have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Tuesday's trading. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  spokesman said he couldn't comment on whether the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Tuesday's trading, citing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par policy.\par    -Keefe Borden\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT  09-09-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1454GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1068 1802 1845 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt9900cn1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
