de Colombia until after the field's production begins to decline. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-01-97 \par \par \uc2  2247GMT \par \par \uc2  1106 1838 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1l00fjz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
