\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Peso Gains, Prompting  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 November 1996\par 22:38\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2  peso strengthened against the dollar Wednesday, prompting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken its value, a trader said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's weighted exchange rate fell to 993.58 pesos, from 994.44 pesos on Tuesday, with intraday trading fluctuating between 993.5 pesos and 993.9 pesos to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The total \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  volume was $70 million in 139 separate transactions, considered relatively light by the standards of recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  The trader said the peso was boosted by a strong showing of exports of oil, coffee and coal, while the demand for the dollar was weak. \par \par \uc2  The automobile assembly industry bought dollars to meet international obligations, but the trader said the amount wasn't enough to halt the peso's strengthening trend. \par \par \uc2  The dollar hit the floor of the exchange band set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the second time this year, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to step in and buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows trading to occur within pre-set minimum and maximum trading values. On Wednesday, the floor was set at 993.5 pesos to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but one trader said his bank estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $5 million on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 27-11-96 \par \par \uc2  2138GMT \par \par \uc2  1068 1802 1845 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013dsbr00nfv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
