\par\par \b \uc2  Colombia  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  vows to push down peso. \b0\par\par\uc2 194 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 November 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, Nov 15 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  promised stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to push down the value of the peso next year, its co-director Hernando Jose Gomez said Friday. \par \par \uc2  He warned that without active \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  an expected flood of dollars into the country from increased exports of crude oil would drive up the Colombian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has come under fire from leading exporters and government ministers in recent weeks as the peso continues to strengthen, thereby slashing value of export earnings when converted into the Colombian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "There will be more active \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money markets by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  next year. The exact level will depend on the inflation target for 1997 that we're currently studying," Gomez told the second day of the annual conference of Colombia's National Exporters' Association. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Jose Antonio Ocampo said on Thursday he hoped the peso would drop to a more beneficial exchange rate next year but mentioned no precise goal. \par \par \uc2  The 1996 target was for a 13.5 percent devaluation of the peso against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsbf00fp7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
