\par\par \b \uc2  Colombian  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  plays down peso weakness. \b0\par\par\uc2 197 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 April 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, April 18 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  director Miguel Urrutia played down the recent weakness of Colombia's peso, saying the bank had only spent about $300 million so far this year in market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Given (\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) reserves of about $8 billion, this is something we consider reasonable," Urrutia said of the Banco de la Republica's dollar sales in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "It's a limited \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he added in remarks to the Finance Committee of the House of Representatives. \par \par \uc2  The peso, under pressure from political uncertainty, has slipped 6.72 percent against the dollar so far this year. \par \par \uc2  The official devaluation target for the entire year is 13.5 percent and Urrutia said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no intention of altering the daily exchange rate band the peso is allowed to trade within. \par \par \uc2  "It's important that there be some assurance that the exchange rate is under control," he said. \par \par \uc2  He added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the last three weeks. \par \par \uc2  -- Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba000002001101