\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Peso Slides As  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervenes \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 219 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 1996\par 23:30\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--The Colombian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent an estimated $90 million defending the peso Wednesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders remained cautious in the days before the U.S. government announces its assessment of Colombia's antinarcotics efforts. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's weighted exchange rate rose to 1,039.82 pesos from 1,039.23 pesos on Tuesday, with intraday trading fluctuating between 1,039.7 pesos and 1,039.85 pesos. \par \par \uc2  While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set a floor of 1,039.82 for Wednesday's session, a trader said it allowed a few isolated exchanges to occur at 1,039.85. \par \par \uc2  One \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market remains shaken by the U.S. government's upcoming evaluation of Colombia's antinarcotics efforts. \par \par \uc2  U.S. President Bill Clinton has until Friday to recommend an assessment of Colombia's cooperation against illegal narcotics. A poor assessment could cost Colombia millions of dollars in direct foreign assistance, higher tariffs, and international loans. \par \par \uc2  "Almost no one wants to bring dollars into the country," one \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader said. \par \par \uc2  The Colombian government put additional pressure on the peso Wednesday by buying dollars to pay foreign debts, the trader said. -Keefe Borden \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 02-28-96 \par \par \uc2  1730EST \par \par \uc2  1845 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013ds2s0066c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
