\par\par \b \uc2  Trading In  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Peso Back To Normal After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Februar 1996\par 16:00\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--Trading in the Colombian peso has returned to normal after a week of uncertainty that forced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in late January, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The peso has gradually gained on the dollar since its low of 1,028.14 on Jan. 31. The peso closed at 1,024.17 on Friday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to defend the peso through the end of of January, but hasn't had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since then. \par \par \uc2  Fernando Botero, President Ernesto Samper's former campaign director and defense minister, sparked a political scandal when he announced on Jan. 22 that the president was aware of millions of dollars in campaign contributions from drug traffickers. \par \par \uc2  The allegations caused a temporary run on the peso, although ING-Barings Analyst Rue Swabey noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's level of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  were minimal. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows free market forces to determine the exchange rate within a pre-established boundaries, known as the "exchange band," which allows the peso to fall asmuch as 13.4% against the dollar in 1996. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sells dollars on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market whenever the peso hits the minimum value of the exchange band. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 02-12-96 \par \par \uc2  1000EST \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013ds2c003jy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
