ciation with private petroleum companies. Only 12,000 barrels per day were produced in July under direct concessions. \par \par \uc2  -- Keefe Borden \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 08-17-95 \par \par \uc2  1034EDT \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011025dr8h008zy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
